	(text "1. GL3224-ONY04  USB 3.1 Gen1 (5 Gbps) 2-LUN card reader, QFN-48 7x7, EP = GND (via array)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6c4ea173-eb90-53c8-8eec-7988af6584cf")
	)
	(text "2. POWER  +5V -> VBUS; internal LDOs -> CR_3V3 (pin 25), CR_1V2 (pin 26)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 180.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e24a4826-1ba8-56ea-b538-d21e4e146b57")
	)
	(text "VBUS = +5V (4.75-5.25 V). CR_3V3 / CR_1V2 are the GL3224's own LDO outputs: never tie them to +3V3 or any other rail."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 215.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bf471eb7-2887-50da-82f1-34109ab3faee")
	)
	(text "Genesys GL3224(E) demo board V3.00 + open GL3224 designs: VBUS 2.2-10 uF, DVDD33 2.2-10 uF, AVDD33/DVDD33 pins 0.1-1 uF, AVDD12 2.2 uF,"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "84b4c1f6-a25c-5302-9d3d-d90a4fc7eeb0")
	)
	(text "  DVDD12 1 uF, VUHS 0.1-1 uF, card VCC up to 10 uF. Card power is switched by the GL3224's on-chip FETs (S1M1_VCC / S2M2_VCC);"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 220.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ddac8c57-3387-5d1e-a33e-d7647b737770")
	)
	(text "  card VCC kept at 4.7 uF + 100 nF so the internal 3.3 V LDO is not dipped at card power-on (proven designs use up to 10 uF)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fd1e2f4d-3e17-512b-b781-b648b8a5b656")
	)
	(text "Budget: GL3224 147 mA (SS U0 active) + up to ~200 mA per UHS-I card, all through the internal 5->3.3 V LDO:"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 226.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1f002545-7aad-5a62-b914-48020cbf3f17")
	)
	(text "  ~(5.1-3.3) V x 0.35 A = 0.63 W in the QFN (theta-JA 33 C/W -> +21 K). Thermal pad via array to inner GND planes."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e3509635-7c67-5979-ae14-0fa3768b04fa")
	)
	(text "3. USB / CLOCK / RTERM / ROM OPTIONS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4a5fc480-9426-5737-a00c-784b5e1b7c23")
	)
	(text "Hub link: CR_SS_TX* = hub transmits (220 nF on usb_hub) -> GL3224 RXP/RXN direct. GL3224 TXP/TXN -> 100 nF here -> CR_SS_RX* -> hub."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 83.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2a97f6b3-63f3-5e4e-a3cd-242e0b9c6a20")
	)
	(text "  GL3224 is USB 3.1 Gen1: hub port 1 trains at 5 Gbps (~400 MB/s) - well above UHS-I SDR104 (104 MB/s)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "569f814a-8783-5d51-bda8-93c609ca1963")
	)
	(text "  Gen1 transmitter AC cap range is 75-200 nF, so 100 nF here (the 220 nF Gen2 value is out of range for a Gen1 TX)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 88.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d0b3005e-cabf-54aa-a4e8-2350e99403df")
	)
	(text "No reset pin: internal POR. Boots from ROM (no SPI flash). SPI_CS / SPI_MOSI NC, S1D4-7 NC (MMC 8-bit only)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 91.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "57c1ccbb-b3fa-53f0-bd1c-30d3d70eef02")
	)
	(text "Crystal: GL3224 accepts 25 MHz +-0.03 %; same YXC 3225 part as the hub (JLC basic)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 93.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5dc07aff-d2cc-5903-a796-6f40d1f317a4")
	)
	(text "4. CARD SOCKETS  slot 1 = full-size SD (S1*), slot 2 = microSD (S2*). Both push-push."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 121.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f1308859-ffdf-5bdf-9fce-b0f210d7ee97")
	)
	(text "SD-111 (Hanbo drawing): CD switch to pin 3 VSS1 closes with a card; WP switch to GND closes when the card is UNLOCKED, open when"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "87870b53-709e-5618-a5aa-3b0188007fe8")
	)
	(text "  locked or no card -> GL3224 SD1_WP (46k internal pull-up): 0 = write enable, 1 = write protect. Matches directly, no inverter."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 175.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4b4c1203-87f7-5e71-bbb1-2ef2dc3f5184")
	)
	(text "  Pin 2 is MS1_INS/SD1_WP: with no card the WP switch is open (high) so no false Memory Stick insert is seen."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
